    {
      "id": "claim_d0c69af471604ebab8ac413792b37275",
      "statement": "The ML pipeline is not started automatically: entrypoint.sh only writes configuration (including a fresh MLAPI_SECRET_KEY into /etc/zm/secrets.ini) and its mlapi launch line (python3 /usr/src/app/mlapi/mlapi.py -c mlapiconfig.ini) and the zmeventnotification.pl daemon launch are both commented out, so mlapi must be started manually or via a supervisor before face enrollment or inference can happen.",
